{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t在深圳出席亞太經合組織會議的行政長官李家超表示，對國家主席習近平在工商領導人峰會開幕式發表的主旨演講，感到十分振奮和鼓舞。<br/>\n<br/>\n李家超又分別和多個亞太經合組織經濟體領袖雙邊會談，包括越南國家主席蘇林、泰國總理阿努廷和文萊蘇丹哈桑納爾等。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:04:16.082498+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T11:45:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:57:35.842831+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:57:22.271889+00:00","content_hash":"104a6f651675ce7207874ebbc0738bae473fd0ede697d9e8911816104f7f4018","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}